    "zh": "从左到右三组：通道（errors、connection、request）打底，身体代理（remote-scheduler、remote-osc、remote-controller-input）把动作发往化身，世界代理（remote-autonomy、remote-telemetry、remote-vmc、remote-vision）取回世界与感知；箭头表示各代理调用远端的方向。",
